{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_148_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"一、十有六年，春，王正月，雨，木冰。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"雨而木冰，志異也。傳曰，根枝折。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，辛未，滕子卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"三、鄭公子喜帥師侵宋。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"四、六月，丙寅，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"五、甲午，晦，晉侯及楚子、鄭伯戰於鄢陵。楚子、鄭師敗績。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"日事遇晦曰晦，四體偏斷曰敗，此其敗則目也。楚不言師，君重於師也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"六、楚殺其大夫公子側。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"七、秋，公會晉侯、齊侯、衞侯、宋華元、邾人於沙隨，不見公。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"不見公者，可以見公也。可以見公而不見公，譏在諸侯也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"八、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"九、公會尹子、晉侯、齊國佐、邾人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"十、曹伯歸自京師。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"不言所歸，歸之善者也。出入不名，以為不失其國也。歸為善，自某歸次之。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"十一、九月，晉人執季孫行父，舍之於苕丘。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"執者不舍，而舍公所也。執者致，而不致，公在也。何其執而辭也？猶存公也。存意公亦存也，公存也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"十二、冬，十月，乙亥，叔孫僑如出奔齊。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"十三、十有二月，乙丑，季孫行父及晉郤犨盟於扈。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_19","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"十四、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_20","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"十五、乙酉，刺公子偃。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_clt_148_21","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_148","textTraditional":"大夫日卒，正也。先刺後名，殺無罪也。","sentenceOrder":21}],"overrides":{}}